  Lines:
  - 'Not built yet: The Alchemist''s Hooks (the hook swords).'
  - 'Not built yet. Here will be The court alchemist''s bough on the Twin Knives''s Way, the weapon tree: taking Poison from its god opens it and gives The Alchemist''s Hooks (the hook swords). Neither the weapon nor its moves are made yet. The court alchemist is not built yet either. The Way arrives in phase 5 of the playtest.'
