  - 'Not built yet. Here will be Carnwyn''s bough on the Scythe''s Way, the weapon tree: taking Life from its god opens it and gives Carnwyn''s Golden Scythe. Neither the weapon nor its moves are made yet. Carnwyn is not built yet either. The Way arrives in phase 5 of the playtest.'
