  Lines:
  - 'Not built yet: The Huntress''s Bow.'
  - 'Not built yet. Here will be The huntress of the snows''s bough on the Great Bow''s Way, the weapon tree: taking Ice from its god opens it and gives The Huntress''s Bow. Neither the weapon nor its moves are made yet. The huntress of the snows is not built yet either. The Way arrives in phase 5 of the playtest.'
